// The inference lines lead with zuerst and keep the du: the clipped
// du-less form reads as if something was swallowed (Stefan's pattern,
// 2026-08-25). The exit line follows the POSTURE, like the reports:
// whoever sat or lay stands up first; whoever stood or climbed climbs
// down first.
block line_foresight_take()
    say "(zuerst nimmst du ${the:acc noun})"

block line_foresight_open(obj)
